{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO INFORMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Finch &amp; Archie Demo! Come get a taste of solving murder mysteries as either the hard-nosed detective, Jack Finch, or his spunky new police dog, Archie. Use your magnifying glass or sniff out clues, interrogate suspects, and share your findings with your partner in order to bring justice to the crime-ridden city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo consists of:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prologue (Tutorial) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good chunk of Episode 1 - A Shot in the Bark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is feature-complete but will not include the entire episode. If you enjoyed solving the murder, get the rest of Episode 1 in the EA release!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COOP PLAY: CHOOSE THE COP OR THE DOG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finch &amp; Archie is a two-player co-op. You can choose to be either the weathered detective Jack Finch or the good boy Archie. Please don\u2019t fight over who gets to be the dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/08943f5e907cdad59f272b0a678026cf.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/08943f5e907cdad59f272b0a678026cf.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND A WAY TO COMMUNICATE WITH YOUR PARTNER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you are a human-dog partnership, communication does not come easy. You will have to be creative to explain your findings to your partner. The mystery cannot be solved without sharing evidence between yourselves \u2013 but unless you speak dog (or can bark in human), you\u2019ll need to find creative ways to communicate with your partner\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/beaa71989df6d9f99664c8f59df7300f.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/beaa71989df6d9f99664c8f59df7300f.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/beaa71989df6d9f99664c8f59df7300f.mp4?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRING YOUR UNIQUE SKILLS TO THE INVESTIGATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Finch and Archie bring their own strengths and unique skills to the investigation. Use either your magnifying glass or your excellent sense of smell to find and gather evidence that will help you with your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/801f342090a5ef0d0f898e3736c9f7c3.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/801f342090a5ef0d0f898e3736c9f7c3.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/801f342090a5ef0d0f898e3736c9f7c3.mp4?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERROGATE SUSPECTS AND WITNESSES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspects can be as wily as witnesses can be unreliable. Question their motives, find out their alibis, poke holes in their testimonies, and use evidence to catch them in lies and contradictions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/d9438bc0bf89184ef6a0cfafac5985e2.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/d9438bc0bf89184ef6a0cfafac5985e2.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/d9438bc0bf89184ef6a0cfafac5985e2.mp4?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOTHER NIGHT, ANOTHER CASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a collection of hard-boiled, noir crime stories set in the Great Depression. Finch &amp; Archie is an episodic game, and each episode opens a new investigation \u2013 but they are all tied into an overarching story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018080?t=1759422561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018080?t=1759422561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/6a79efd4418ff3ae74da619eaeaaf1fedb4e6c15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759422561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/6a79efd4418ff3ae74da619eaeaaf1fedb4e6c15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759422561","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO INFORMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Finch &amp; Archie Demo! Come get a taste of solving murder mysteries as either the hard-nosed detective, Jack Finch, or his spunky new police dog, Archie. Use your magnifying glass or sniff out clues, interrogate suspects, and share your findings with your partner in order to bring justice to the crime-ridden city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo consists of:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prologue (Tutorial) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good chunk of Episode 1 - A Shot in the Bark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is feature-complete but will not include the entire episode. If you enjoyed solving the murder, get the rest of Episode 1 in the EA release!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COOP PLAY: CHOOSE THE COP OR THE DOG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finch &amp; Archie is a two-player co-op. You can choose to be either the weathered detective Jack Finch or the good boy Archie. Please don\u2019t fight over who gets to be the dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/08943f5e907cdad59f272b0a678026cf.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/08943f5e907cdad59f272b0a678026cf.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND A WAY TO COMMUNICATE WITH YOUR PARTNER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you are a human-dog partnership, communication does not come easy. You will have to be creative to explain your findings to your partner. The mystery cannot be solved without sharing evidence between yourselves \u2013 but unless you speak dog (or can bark in human), you\u2019ll need to find creative ways to communicate with your partner\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/beaa71989df6d9f99664c8f59df7300f.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/beaa71989df6d9f99664c8f59df7300f.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/beaa71989df6d9f99664c8f59df7300f.mp4?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRING YOUR UNIQUE SKILLS TO THE INVESTIGATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Finch and Archie bring their own strengths and unique skills to the investigation. Use either your magnifying glass or your excellent sense of smell to find and gather evidence that will help you with your case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/801f342090a5ef0d0f898e3736c9f7c3.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/801f342090a5ef0d0f898e3736c9f7c3.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/801f342090a5ef0d0f898e3736c9f7c3.mp4?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERROGATE SUSPECTS AND WITNESSES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspects can be as wily as witnesses can be unreliable. Question their motives, find out their alibis, poke holes in their testimonies, and use evidence to catch them in lies and contradictions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/d9438bc0bf89184ef6a0cfafac5985e2.poster.avif?t=1759422561\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/d9438bc0bf89184ef6a0cfafac5985e2.webm?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/extras/d9438bc0bf89184ef6a0cfafac5985e2.mp4?t=1759422561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOTHER NIGHT, ANOTHER CASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a collection of hard-boiled, noir crime stories set in the Great Depression. Finch &amp; Archie is an episodic game, and each episode opens a new investigation \u2013 but they are all tied into an overarching story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["OctarineArts"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2642500","name":"Finch & Archie"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018080/3b4f68ff540496a9668b5752451e521bfbdf